{"kind":"table","sheet":"API Matrix","address":"A1:G16","rows":16,"cols":7,"values":[["CNF API / Service Implementation Matrix",null,null,null,null,null,null],["Simple current-state view based on v1.9 and runtime/BAPI evidence through 22 Aug 2026",null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["v1.9 ID","API / Service","Standard SAP / Existing Route","BAPI / FM / Source","Reality Today","Build Decision","Implementation Required"],["MIGO-02","Submit MIGO","API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV (standard OData V2)","BAPI_GOODSMVT_CREATE is the standard BAPI alternative; direct OData remains the selected route","External POST accepted the payload and reached MM posting-period control (M7/053). The standard route works; no material document could post until the period is fixed. Transport is prepared, not imported to QS4.","Standard direct","Transport/register the standard service, maintain alias and roles, then run a positive posting. Keep replay/status handling outside SAP; add small custom handling only if DMG/STG rejection needs its own ledger."],["OF-01","Create DI","API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2 (standard OData deep insert)","BAPI_OUTB_DELIVERY_CREATE_STO / BAPI_OUTB_DELIVERY_CREATE_SLS are alternatives, not the selected endpoint","Proven end to end in QS4: HTTP 201 created delivery 9004953174 and LIKP/LIPS readback confirmed persistence. The tested branch was STO.","Standard direct","Reuse the proven deep-insert request. Test Trade and Non-trade sales-order predecessors, then add only CPI/T2 replay, error mapping and response shaping."],["OF-03","Stock Availability","API_MATERIAL_STOCK_SRV - GET A_MatlStkInAcctMod","No equivalent BAPI selected. BAPI_MATERIAL_AVAILABILITY is ATP and answers a different question.","Metadata and empty reads are proven. DS4 has no book-stock rows, so populated quantities have not yet been reconciled.","Standard direct","Use filtered reads by plant, storage location, material, batch and stock type. Reconcile against MMBE/MB52. Keep descriptions and stock ageing in T2/Datasphere."],["OF-05","Pre-PGI: Pick, Shipment and Freight","Delivery-v2 picking actions plus existing SAP LE-TRA freight functions","BAPI_SHIPMENT_CREATE; SD_SCDS_CREATE; SD_SCD_ITEM_CALCULATE; SD_SCD_ITEM_ACCT_ASSIGNMENT; SD_SCDS_RELEASE; SD_SCDS_SAVE","Shipment creation persisted when explicitly committed. Cost creation is callable and release runs headless, but a real freight document has not been settled end to end.","Custom exposure","Build ZCNF_PREPGI_SRV as a controlled wrapper/orchestrator. Reuse SAP freight logic; add commit boundaries, stage state, locking, partial-failure recovery and one real settlement test."],["OF-06","Create PGI","API_OUTBOUND_DELIVERY_SRV;v=2 - PostGoodsIssue / ReverseGoodsIssue","No BAPI selected. Existing client code also uses WS_DELIVERY_UPDATE, but the standard OData action is preferred.","Function signatures and metadata are confirmed; PostGoodsIssue itself has not yet been executed in the current test pack.","Standard direct","Execute PGI and reversal against a controlled delivery, read back the material document/document flow, and confirm movement behaviour for Trade, Non-trade and STO."],["OF-07","Create Invoice","API_BILLING_DOCUMENT_SRV for read/PDF only; it cannot create billing documents","BAPI_BILLINGDOC_CREATEMULTIPLE + BAPI_TRANSACTION_COMMIT; SD_CUSTOMER_INVOICES_CREATE remains an internal alternative","The released billing OData create route does not exist. The BAPI is used by the client's ZMM_STO_AUTO_POSTING report but has not been executed in the current API test pack.","Custom exposure","Build ZCNF_BILLING_SRV around the BAPI, own commit and persistence checks, then read back through the standard billing API and hand off to the existing statutory process."],["OF-08","Create Order (STO)","API_PURCHASEORDER_PROCESS_SRV can read POs but its create operation does not support the required STO shape","BAPI_PO_CREATE1 + BAPI_TRANSACTION_COMMIT; ZMM_STO_AUTO_POSTING is the client reference implementation","OData create was executed and structurally rejected ZP06/PSTYP 7. BAPI testing passed STO document-type validation with UB, and client code supplies the exact ZP06 payload. A real ZP06 create is still pending.","Custom exposure","Build ZCNF_STO_SRV using the client's actual payload: supplying plant in VENDOR, purchasing group 119, storage location, BANFN and BEDNR mappings, X structures, commit, replay protection and readback."],["INV-01","E-Way Bill Extension","Existing SAP eDocument + DigiGST/EY provider route; no standard SEGW service","No BAPI identified. BADI_EDOCUMENT_IN_EWB is an enhancement point, not the callable API.","The installed framework, DigiGST tables and EY destinations are confirmed. The callable class/FM and a real extension request have not been traced.","Existing route","Trace the supported add-on call and provider response first. Expose only a narrow CNF command if no approved callable boundary already exists; never update statutory tables directly."],["INV-02","Invoice Correction","Existing SAP eDocument + DigiGST/EY correction/cancel/regenerate route","No justified BAPI for the required transport-detail correction","Historical correction cycles exist, but the supported callable implementation and separate e-Invoice/E-Way Bill outcomes are not yet proven.","Existing route","Trace the existing add-on action, confirm cancel/regenerate behaviour, then expose a narrow command only if required. Do not directly update billing or DigiGST tables."],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Bottom line: no complete custom business-process rebuild is currently proven necessary. Custom SAP work is mainly controlled exposure/orchestration around standard or existing logic.",null,null,null,null,null,null],["This matrix contains the nine real implementation services. The non-existent 'Show Inward MRNs' placeholder is intentionally excluded.",null,null,null,null,null,null]]}
